    "intent": "Add a bounded receipt-verification timeout that raises an SDK verification error when the CLI hangs.\n\nDone means:\nReceiptVerifier accepts a verification-specific positive finite timeout keyword (timeout, default 5 seconds). A verifier hanging with timeout=0.1 raises AegisVerificationError within 1 second and leaves no owned verifier process. Invalid zero, negative, NaN, infinity, Boolean and non-numeric timeout values raise AegisConfigurationError. Successful and nonzero-exit verifier behavior and existing SDK tests remain intact.\n\nAllowed changed paths: sdk/python/**\n",
